	<h2>Purpose of the publication</h2>

	<p>
		A personal, non-commercial site publishing free crochet patterns and write-ups of yarn,
		fibre and stitch tests. It reflects one person's own work and opinions.
	</p>

	<p>
		The site is <strong>not a shop</strong>. Nothing is sold here, there is no advertising, and
		there are no affiliate links or sponsored content. Where patterns are sold, that happens on
		Ravelry, under that platform's terms.
	</p>

	<h2>Basic direction</h2>

	<p>
		Free, fully written crochet patterns, and honest test results — including the ones that did
		not support the conclusion I wanted.
	</p>

	<h2>Content and liability</h2>

	<p>
		Patterns and test results are published in good faith and to the best of my knowledge. Yarn
		behaves differently in different hands, and gauge is personal: swatch before you commit to a
		project. No liability is accepted for the outcome of a project worked from a pattern here.
	</p>

	<p>
		Links to external sites lead to content outside my control, for which I accept no
		responsibility.
	</p>

	<h2>Copyright</h2>

	<p>
		Patterns, text and photographs on this site are mine. What you may and may not do with the
		patterns is set out on the <a href="/licence/">pattern terms</a> page.
	</p>

